{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e4e9b2aabaed45b7","name":"Armor Specialist Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-e4e9b2aabaed45b7","title":"Armor Specialist Talent Tree","revision":15908,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:23Z","sha256":"56c85ff1f4172b7d8a4c0e6eff657a81262bd90c90c2a4fab0995ded37b77c6c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15908","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Armor%20Specialist%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e4e9b2aabaed45b7","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can maximize the benefits of wearing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," while reducing or eliminating some of its drawbacks.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Armor Mastery"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite: "]},{"tag":"b","children":["Armored Defense"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus of your armor improves by +1. You must be proficient with the armor you are wearing to gain this benefit.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Armored Defense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When calculating your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},", you may add either your Heroic Level or your Armor bonus, whichever is higher. You must be proficient with the armor you are wearing to gain this benefit.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Armored Defense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite: "]},{"tag":"b","children":["Armored Defense"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When calculating your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},", you may add your Heroic Level plus one-half your Armor bonus (rounded down), or your Armor bonus, whichever is higher. You must be proficient with the armor you are wearing to gain this benefit.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Juggernaut"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite: "]},{"tag":"b","children":["Armored Defense"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your armor does not reduce your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," or the distance you can move while ",{"tag":"a","children":["Running"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Running"},". You must be proficient with the armor you are wearing to gain this benefit.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Second Skin"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite: "]},{"tag":"b","children":["Armored Defense"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When wearing armor with which you are proficient, your Armor bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," each increases by +1.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Shield Expert"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Proficiency (Light)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Proficiency_(Light)","referenceId":"reference:5c5fd1ac409e0220"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are an expert in using ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Shields"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Shields","referenceId":"reference:98d76f0e28772518"}," for maximum effectiveness. Once per encounter, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to regain 10 points of SR (up to the shield's maximum) on an active ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Shield"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Shield"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
